(card "exp:F-R2-2_vpin_drop_q70_300s" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:F-R2-2_vpin_drop_q70_300s"
  :body "---\nnav: 28\ntype: experiment\nid: F-R2-2_vpin_drop_q70_300s\nshort_name: vpin_drop_q70_300s\ntitle: \"F-R2-2 — anchor + drop VPIN@300s trailing-cum q70+ (more aggressive)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: f\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_f__microstructure]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.7290\ntrain_trade_count: 92\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8478\ntrain_sharpe: 7.5685\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0446\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0597\nval_window_count: 12\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [microstructure, blacklist]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: 10\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/f, round/r2, axis/microstructure, axis/blacklist, status/falsified, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/small]\n---\n\n# F-R2-2 — anchor + drop VPIN@300s q70+\n\n> **TL;DR** —— F-R2 sweep 中更激进 cutoff 档：drop q70+ vs F-R2-1 的 q80+。train 砍到 92 笔, NAV 1.73 远低 anchor —— 越激进越败。未上 test。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：q80+ cutoff 太宽松 (10% drop), 改 q70+ (30% drop) 应当更强力 drop bad leg。\n- 实测：drop 太多 → sample 崩。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 同 F-R2-1, cutoff q70 instead of q80. 92 笔.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- trailing-cum past-only. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.7290 | 92 | 7.57 | 84.8% | -1.01% |\n| Val (12w only) | 1.0446 ± 0.060 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN | - | - | - | - |\n| **Δ train NAV vs anchor** | -0.46 | -48 | -0.13 | -0.9pp | 0 |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0; count_pass=False (val 12w not 13).\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-1__vpin_drop_q80_300s]]\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-3__vpin_drop_q80_600s]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_f/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (F-R2-2)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- cutoff sensitivity: q70 → q80 是 monotone NAV 改善但都败。说明不是 cutoff 调节问题，是 VPIN 信号本身 unproductive。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-2__vpin_drop_q70_300s.md"
